<title>NETHERLANDS: Unigro to buy Spanish retail chain La Concha.</title>
<headline>Unigro to buy Spanish retail chain La Concha.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch unlisted supermarket wholesaler Unigro NV said on Wednesday it would buy the 17 shops of Spanish regional supermarket chain La Concho.</p>
</text>
